        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Choosing an eye doctor in Pine Beach is about more than just your vision. At <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Academy Vision</a>, our team is made up of experienced optometrists who take the time to listen, explain, and make sure you feel comfortable. Whether you’ve been coming here for years or you’re visiting for the first time for an <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">eye exam</a>, you’ll be treated like more than just another appointment.</p>",
          "id": "9yNcnwLgrT",
          "origin": "static"
        }
      ]
    },
